Exceptions
(24)
Students who have completed the relevant subjects at La Trobe either as part of a course or as a Single Subject enrolment, are exempt from the minimum requirements above. This exception does not apply to students enrolled in concurrent courses and is limited to:
current La Trobe students who have not taken out the award for their current course, and who apply for an internal transfer into another La Trobe course with subjects in common (unless that course is a Restricted Entry Course);
students who apply and gain re-admission to their prior course of study at La Trobe;
La Trobe students who have completed a nested or alternate exit qualification, and subsequently seek entry to the associated higher qualification.
